MODULE: ResolvedCandidateOwnsCache
TARGET: CacheOwned
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: Candidate capture adopts a new owner before the actual tail changes
PERTURBS: Capture

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<tail,owner,resolved,order,prepared,terminal,stagedOwner,
        read,heads,offsets,projections,liveBinding,durableBinding,candidate,outcome>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ owner' = candidate
    /\ UNCHANGED <<tail,resolved,order,prepared,terminal,stagedOwner,
        read,heads,offsets,projections,liveBinding,durableBinding,candidate,outcome>>
--- END
